{
  "id": "poem-de79619eb2eecfcb122cb0b5",
  "title": "同前",
  "author": "无名氏《张协状元》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "今君转下山，有一家。",
    "朱门两扇屋虽破，是鸳鸯瓦。",
    "(生)又怎知它着我？谢得尊神呵周全我，今宵免得心肠挂。",
    "(合同前)(生)。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-2491",
